    "description": {
      "values": [
        {
          "locale": "en-US",
          "value": "Suede changes what a trench is. The shape is orthodox - classic collar, double-breasted front, belt at the waist - but in real leather with a soft napped finish it stops reading as practical outerwear and starts reading as the outfit. At 122cm it falls to mid-calf, and the belt decides between a column line and a cinched one depending on how you tie it. Two slip pockets at the front, tonal lining throughout. Dry clean only, and worth it."
        },
        {
          "locale": "en-GB",
          "value": "Suede changes what a trench is. The shape is orthodox - classic collar, double-breasted front, belt at the waist - but in real leather with a soft napped finish it stops reading as practical outerwear and starts reading as the outfit. At 122cm it falls to mid-calf, and the belt decides between a column line and a cinched one depending on how you tie it. Two slip pockets at the front, tonal lining throughout. Dry clean only, and worth it."
        },
        {
          "locale": "es-ES",
          "value": "El ante cambia lo que es una trinchera. La forma es ortodoxa —cuello clásico, botonadura cruzada, cinturón en la cintura—, pero en piel auténtica y con un acabado aterciopelado deja de leerse como abrigo práctico y empieza a leerse como el look entero. Con 122cm cae a media pantorrilla, y el cinturón decide entre una línea columna y una marcada según cómo lo anudes. Dos bolsillos de abertura delante y forro a tono en todo el interior. Solo limpieza en seco, y lo vale."
        },
        {
          "locale": "fr-FR",
          "value": "Le daim change la nature d'un trench. La forme est orthodoxe - col classique, double boutonnage, ceinture à la taille - mais en cuir véritable au fini velouté souple, il cesse de se lire comme un vêtement de pluie utilitaire et devient la tenue elle-même. À 122cm, il tombe à mi-mollet, et c'est la ceinture qui tranche entre une ligne colonne et une taille marquée, selon la façon de la nouer. Deux poches glissées devant, doublure ton sur ton. Nettoyage à sec uniquement, et il le mérite."
        },
        {
          "locale": "de-DE",
          "value": "Veloursleder verändert, was ein Trenchcoat ist. Die Form ist orthodox – klassischer Kragen, zweireihige Knopfleiste, Gürtel in der Taille –, aber in echtem Leder mit weich angeschliffener Oberfläche wirkt er nicht mehr wie praktische Oberbekleidung, sondern wie das gesamte Outfit. Mit 122cm reicht er bis zur Wadenmitte, und der Gürtel entscheidet je nach Bindeart zwischen gerader Säule und betonter Taille. Zwei Eingrifftaschen vorn, durchgehend tonales Futter. Nur chemische Reinigung – und das lohnt sich."
        },
        {
          "locale": "it-IT",
          "value": "La pelle scamosciata cambia la natura di un trench. La forma è ortodossa - collo classico, doppiopetto, cintura in vita - ma in vera pelle con una finitura vellutata morbida smette di leggersi come capospalla pratico e inizia a leggersi come l'outfit intero. Con i suoi 122cm arriva a metà polpaccio, e la cintura decide tra una linea a colonna e una segnata in vita a seconda di come la annodi. Due tasche a filo sul davanti, fodera in tono su tutto il capo. Solo lavaggio a secco, e ne vale la pena."
        }
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "schema": "http://bigcontent.io/cms/schema/v1/core#/definitions/localized-value"
      }
    }
